      ],
      "text": "Severe CAP (immunocompetent inpatients):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " adjunctive glucocorticoids are recommended; early IV hydrocortisone 200 mg/day by cont infusion for 4–7 days ↓mortality in trials, though a later ICU trial showed a less favorable benefit-risk ratio."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
